# SYNOPSIS

```text
protocol todhchai.radharc.Chooser version 8
one-way begin(
    id: UInt64,
    view: Opened,
    mode: ChooseMode,
    types: [String],
    name: String,
    app: String
)
one-way cancel(id: UInt64)
call confirm(id: UInt64) throws(WindowError) -> Handle
```

# DESCRIPTION

Tracker's file chooser, called by Radharc when a window calls `choose`
(D111).

Protocol `todhchai.radharc.Chooser`, version 8, of library `RadharcIPC`, its messages in the one wire format (wire(6)).

| Method | Kind | Since | Ordinal |
| `begin` | one-way | 1 | `0x57138a6834db31cc` |
| `cancel` | one-way | 1 | `0x16e09aaf3c227e9d` |
| `confirm` | call | 1 | `0x59fadf96461ae48d` |

: `begin`
  Starts chooser `id` in `view` for `mode`, `types` and `name`, on
  behalf of `app`.
: `cancel`
  Cancels chooser `id` and closes its view.
: `confirm`
  Confirms the selection or file name in chooser `id` and returns a
  confined channel to the file (`invalid` if nothing is chosen).

